# Original web project (not part of Unity).
# Anchored with a leading slash on purpose: an unanchored "data/" matches ANY
# directory named data at any depth, and on Windows it is case-insensitive too,
# so it silently swallowed unity/Assets/Resources/Data/ — all 54 game data files
# were missing from the repo. Same bug class as 216b27a8. Keep these anchored.
/electron/
/node_modules/
/data/
/start.bat
